cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below. It is a simulation study; no sensor has been built or tested."
title: "fbg-force-sleeve: an open design study for a clip-on fiber Bragg grating force-sensing sleeve"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Bouargane"
    given-names: "Yassine"
date-released: "2026-11-11"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/yabouargane/fbg-force-sleeve"
keywords:
  - fiber Bragg grating
  - laparoscopy
  - force sensing
  - temperature compensation
  - open hardware
abstract: "A simulation and 3D design study of a clip-on sleeve with four optical fibers (three strained, one strain-free reference) that could measure the lateral force on the shaft of a manual laparoscopic instrument and separate it from heat. Research use only. Not a medical device."
